    "message": "As of version 10.0, the Dynamsoft.DotNet.Barcode package has been renamed to Dynamsoft.DotNet.BarcodeReader.Bundle to reflect changes in both architecture and API design. To get the latest features, updates, and bug fixes, please install and use the new package.",
